WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:02,340
can you be more serious

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,100
Okay, okay, I'm serious

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,020
But please don't show off here, okay?

4
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,140
Who is this person?

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,660
Why did I follow you here?

6
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:17,560
This is the bodyguard my dad found for me.

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,360
What did I think it was?

8
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,200
Didn't I just find a bodyguard for you?

9
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,340
What's there to worry about?

10
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,660
Others are others, I am me

11
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,580
Don’t you know my character yet?

12
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,260
I moved out on my own when I was eighteen.

13
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:34,850
I don't even want to live with my dad

14
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:36,370
follow me all day

15
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:38,490
Can I tolerate a man following me around all day?

16
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:42,930
Say it again

17
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,970
What my dad found for me was not an ordinary bodyguard.

18
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:47,970
It's a bodyguard

19
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,260
That's twenty-four hours a day

20
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:51,860
It's so annoying to never leave.

21
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,700
so you see

22
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:55,140
I even came here to have a meal with you

23
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:56,060
He must follow

24
00:00:56,660 --> 00:01:00,940
You can see the door from here and you can see him

25
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:02,660
bodyguard

26
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:03,980
twenty four hours

27
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:06,980
Does he accompany me when I sleep and go to the toilet?
